{
	"name": "SettingsMenu",
	"_doc": "The settings menu (src/client/SettingsMenu), Field Grimoire's notebook (UI overhaul, user 2026-10-30: \"I like the notebook settings\"): one sheet of map paper with a torn edge and ink rim (paper: Config/SketchMap.Paper) and a fold down it; the left page has the title, the tabs down it (`vertical`, each with its rune: `runes`, Config/Runes names), the open one dark and underlined in red pencil, and 'Esc closes' at the foot; the right page has the open tab's options, each its name above its control. Chosen values are an ink block with paper words, the rest a thin blue line round dark words. One font, the game's basic font. Sizes in reference pixels at theme.scale.referenceHeight, one UIScale, never taller than the GUI area less theme.fitMargin. Colours are Config/Palette UI.Grimoire.Notebook names (theme.palette). Desktop only. The four *Row nodes are the row templates by option kind (Config/Settings.Tabs); Seg buttons, Tab buttons and the slider parts are preview samples, the menu makes one per value / tab. The gear (top right) sits on the ink plate (`slab`).",
